      "outputs": [
        "org.jsoup.nodes.ElementSelector"
      ],
      "details": "Extract selection/search related methods from Element into a new helper class org.jsoup.nodes.ElementSelector. Move the following methods (and any small private helpers that are only used by them) into ElementSelector as instance or static methods that take an Element as a parameter: select(String), select(Evaluator), selectStream(String), selectStream(Evaluator), selectFirst(String), selectFirst(Evaluator), expectFirst(String), selectNodes(String), selectNodes(Evaluator), selectNodes(String, Class<T>), selectNodes(Evaluator, Class<T>), selectFirstNode(String, Class<T>), selectFirstNode(Evaluator, Class<T>), expectFirstNode(String, Class<T>), selectXpath(String) [OPTIONAL: leave selectXpath in Element if desired], is(String), is(Evaluator), closest(String), closest(Evaluator), and the getElementsBy* / getElementById / getElementsMatching*/getElementsContaining* family of methods that delegate to Collector or Selector. The extracted ElementSelector will encapsulate direct calls to Selector.select, Selector.selectFirst, Selector.selectStream, Collector.collect, Collector.findFirst, Collector.collectNodes, and Regex.compile. After extraction, Element's implementations of these methods will be replaced with thin delegating calls to ElementSelector (UPDATE_CALL_SITES).",
      "risk": "medium"
    },
